## 5. Safety & Integrity Requirements
The Software may NOT be used to create:
- harmful, deceptive, or unsafe systems  
- surveillance or biometric tracking systems  
- cloud‑based AI services  
- external AI model training pipelines  
- systems bypassing identity or safety layers  
- hybrid‑unsafe systems violating SIRIUS 3.x rules  

---------------------------------------------------------------------

## 6. Hybrid‑Safe Architecture Clause (New in 3.1.0)
All systems built on top of the Software must respect the **Hybrid‑Safe Architecture**:

- online data is always **low‑trust**  
- no untrusted data may reach offline reasoning, packs, or vision modules  
- Secure Online Envoy (if used) must remain isolated and outbound‑only  
- Quarantine Pipeline must sanitize all external data  
- offline core must remain fully air‑gapped  
- no cloud inference, telemetry, or remote execution  

Any attempt to bypass hybrid‑safe rules voids the license.

